sactions before execution.\"<|>\"regulatory compliance, risk mitigation\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"节能低碳原则\"<|>\"清洁能源消纳最大化原则\"<|>\"Guarantees sufficient peak/regulation capacity to maximize clean energy utilization.\"<|>\"sustainability integration, capacity planning\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"信息披露\"<|>\"Discloses grid constraints and adjustment reasons to market entities post-safety checks.\"<|>\"transparency requirement, operational communication\"<|>6)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"grid security, electricity trading, regulatory compliance, clean energy integration, market transparency\")<|COMPLETE|>"
