    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Issued the 'Northwest Region Cross-provincial Electricity Medium-to-Long Term Trading Implementation Rules' to regulate market activities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司西北分部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Receives regulatory notifications and participates in cross-provincial electricity trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网陕西省电力公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial power grid operator under State Grid Corporation participating in regional electricity trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网宁夏电力有限公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial power grid operator under State Grid Corporation participating in regional electricity trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网新疆电力有限公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial power grid operator under State Grid Corporation participating in regional electricity trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网青海省电力公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial power grid operator under State Grid Corporation participating in regional electricity trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网甘肃省电力公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial power grid operator under State Grid Corporation participating in regional electricity trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"北京电力交易中心市场交易六部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Responsible for organizing cross-provincial electricity trading, managing contracts, and operating trading platforms in Northwest China.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省级电力交易机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial-level institutions supporting cross-provincial trading registration, organization, and data provision.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Power generation companies participating in cross-provincial trading with rights to fair grid access and obligations for contract fulfillment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Electricity consumers participating in cross-provincial trading with obligations to provide load data and follow dispatch instructions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Electricity retail companies participating in cross-provincial trading with information disclosure obligations and user privacy responsibilities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新型经营主体\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"New market entities including energy storage companies participating in electricity trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"陕西\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"One of the provinces comprising the Northwest power grid region for cross-provincial trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"甘肃\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"One of the provinces comprising the Northwest power grid region for cross-provincial trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"青海\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"One of the provinces comprising the Northwest power grid region for cross-provincial trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"宁夏\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"One of the provinces comprising the Northwest power grid region for cross-provincial trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新疆\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"One of the provinces comprising the Northwest power grid region for cross-provincial trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西北区域跨省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Regulatory framework establishing rules for cross-provincial electricity trading in Northwest China.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"西北区域跨省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"The regulatory bureau issued and enforces the implementation rules.\"<|>\"regulation issuance, policy enforcement\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"北京电力交易中心市场交易六部\"<|>\"The bureau supervises the trading center's market operations and receives risk reports.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight, market monitoring\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"北京电力交易中心市场交易六部\"<|>\"省级电力交易机构\"<|>\"The central trading department coordinates with provincial institutions for registration and data exchange.\"<|>\"operational coordination, data sharing\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"西北区域跨省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"Generation companies must comply with trading rules outlined in the implementation details.\"<|>\"regulatory compliance, market participation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"陕西\"<|>\"西北区域跨省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"The province is a defi