    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Supervises electricity market information disclosure and enforces regulations in Northwest China.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家能源局甘肃监管办公室\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Regulates electricity market disclosure and conducts evaluations in Gansu Province.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家能源局新疆监管办公室\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Oversees electricity market disclosure compliance and enforcement in Xinjiang.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Manages electricity market transactions and handles information disclosure disputes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Implements risk controls and market intervention measures for grid safety.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西北区域\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Geographical scope for cross-provincial medium-to-long-term electricity trading regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"甘肃\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Province under jurisdiction of Gansu Energy Regulatory Office.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新疆\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Region supervised by Xinjiang Energy Regulatory Office.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"信息披露\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Mandatory disclosure process for electricity market participants.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"信用评价\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Credit assessment mechanism for non-compliant market members.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"市场监管\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Oversight of cross-provincial electricity trading market order.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"风险防控\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Risk prevention measures during market abnormalities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力中长期交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Primary market activity governed by disclosed regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"行政处罚\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Penalty category for violations of disclosure rules.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"信息披露\"<|>\"Directly supervises and evaluates disclosure compliance across provinces.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight, compliance monitoring\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"信息披露\"<|>\"Processes disclosure disputes and ensures timely information release.\"<|>\"dispute resolution, information management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"风险防控\"<|>\"Implements intervention measures during system failures or market manipulation.\"<|>\"crisis management, operational safety\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"信用评价\"<|>\"行政处罚\"<|>\"Credit assessments trigger administrative penalties for violations.\"<|>\"enforcement mechanism, violation consequences\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"市场监管\"<|>\"电力中长期交易\"<|>\"Oversight ensures orderly conduct of cross-provincial electricity trading.\"<|>\"market integrity, transaction governance\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"Regulatory Compliance, Market Supervision, Risk Mitigation, Information Transparency, Enforcement Mechanisms\")<|COMPLETE|>"
